direction: down
title: Apache Kafka KRaft Architecture

Quorum: KRaft Controller Quorum (Internal Metadata Raft) {
  style.fill: "#1E1B4B"
  style.stroke: "#8B5CF6"
  c1: Controller 1 (Leader)
  c2: Controller 2 (Follower)
  c3: Controller 3 (Follower)
}

Brokers: Kafka Data Brokers {
  style.fill: "#06201B"
  style.stroke: "#10B981"
  b101: "Broker 101: P0 (Leader), P1 (Follower)"
  b102: "Broker 102: P1 (Leader), P2 (Follower)"
  b103: "Broker 103: P2 (Leader), P0 (Follower)"
}

Quorum -> Brokers: Metadata event log synchronization { style.stroke: "#8B5CF6" }
